5492, "text": "And he dreamed, and behold a ladder set up on the earth, and the top of it reached to heaven: and behold the angels of God ascending and descending on it.", "words": [[0, 86329], [4, 86453], [7, 86573], [16, 87113], [20, 87213], [27, 87733], [29, 87833], [36, 88113], [40, 88453], [43, 88593], [46, 88793], [50, 88953], [57, 89573], [61, 89833], [65, 89953], [69, 90293], [72, 90433], [75, 90533], [83, 90873], [86, 91093], [94, 91779], [98, 91922], [105, 92222], [109, 92482], [116, 92962], [119, 93182], [123, 93502], [133, 94242], [137, 94422], [148, 94862], [151, 95242]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 95842, "end": 106752, "text": "And, behold, the LORD stood above it, and said, I am the LORD God of Abraham your father, and the God of Isaac: the land on which you lie, to you will I give it, and to your seed;", "words": [[0, 95842], [5, 95983], [13, 96743], [17, 96983], [22, 97263], [28, 97563], [34, 97863], [38, 98103], [42, 98523], [48, 99225], [50, 99362], [53, 99462], [57, 99562], [62, 99782], [66, 100062], [69, 100222], [77, 100822], [82, 100882], [90, 101702], [94, 101762], [98, 101862], [102, 102062], [105, 102182], [112, 103228], [116, 103312], [121, 103592], [124, 103772], [130, 103952], [134, 104132], [139, 104632], [142, 104752], [146, 104972], [151, 105172], [153, 105292], [158, 105452], [162, 105652], [166, 105852], [169, 106012], [174, 106132]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 107328, "end": 118872, "text": "And your seed shall be as the dust of the earth, and you shall spread abroad to the west, and to the east, and to the north, and to the south: and in you and in your seed shall all the families of the earth be blessed.", "words": [[0, 107328], [4, 107464], [9, 107544], [14, 107884], [20, 108124], [23, 108344], [26, 108464], [30, 108604], [35, 108864], [38, 109064], [42, 109184], [49, 109784], [53, 109944], [57, 110064], [63, 110224], [70, 110504], [77, 110864], [80, 111064], [84, 111164], [90, 111524], [94, 111824], [97, 111944], [101, 112064], [107,